<svg viewBox="0 0 720 500" class="block h-auto w-full" role="img" aria-labelledby="arch-cicd-title arch-cicd-desc" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <title id="arch-cicd-title">CI/CD and environments</title>
  <desc id="arch-cicd-desc">App repositories build on in-cluster runners and push images with three tag families. Pull-request tags become review apps through a validated, auto-merged PR; dev tags flow to dev through Flux image automation; QA is pinned by a promotion workflow; production tags fast-forward the platform repo and a post-merge job waits for Flux to apply that exact commit before checking health.</desc>
